    "_postman_id": "c8196c24-e151-4f13-8bdf-f602e0690758",
    "name": "Product Management API",
    "description": "## Overview\n\nThe **Product Management API** collection provides a complete set of endpoints for managing products and their associated pricing within your platform. It is organized into two functional groups:\n\n### Products\n\nFull CRUD operations for product resources:\n\n- **List Products:** Retrieve a paginated list of all available products.\n    \n- **Create Product:** Add a new product to the catalog.\n    \n- **Get Product:** Fetch the details of a specific product by ID.\n    \n- **Update Product:** Modify the attributes of an existing product.\n    \n- **Delete Product:** Remove a product from the catalog.\n    \n\n### Product Prices\n\nEndpoints dedicated to managing pricing for individual products:\n\n- **List Product Prices:** Retrieve all prices associated with a specific product.\n    \n- **Create Product Price:** Define a new price entry for a product.\n    \n\n---\n\n### Variables\n\nThe collection uses two variables:\n\n| Variable | Description |\n| --- | --- |\n| `{{base_url}}` | The base URL of the API server |\n| `{{product_id}}` | The ID of the product to operate on |\n\nSet these in your environment or at the collection level before sending requests.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "926063",
    "_collection_link": "https://go.postman.co/collection/926063-c8196c24-e151-4f13-8bdf-f602e0690758?source=collection_link"
  },
